    "US AQI is never compared with Indian GRAP thresholds. Raw concentrations are preserved but not converted into AQI.",
    "No grade selected: aggregate precaution includes applicable grade groups; mandatory actions list their exact grades (0 means pre-primary)."
  ]
}
